                                                    <attributedString key="attributedText">
                                                        <fragment>
                                                            <string key="content">Attach your datasource as you are creating a new document.  As the document is being created, you will be prompted for the datasource credentials.  If you choose, these credentials are stored in your keychain; they are never stored inside the MAD file.</string>
